# Architecture

- Use Svelte 5 syntax and TypeScript in component scripts.
- Put reusable UI in `src/components/` and feature code in `src/features/<name>/`.
- Keep components declarative; move reusable state and effects into `.svelte.ts` modules.
- Keep HTTP and persistence behind typed modules.
- Prefer props, snippets, and callbacks over implicit cross-component state.
- Keep tests beside the behavior they cover.
